{"id":"claim:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam--wa-isam-resultative-disappearance-sakhalin","revision":1,"topic":"topic:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam","topics":["topic:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam","topic:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam--isam-verb"],"statement":{"en":"In Sakhalin Ainu, the auxiliary construction wa 'isam expresses that something has disappeared or ceased to exist as a result of an action or state.","ja":"樺太アイヌ語において、補助動詞構文 wa 'isam は動作や状態の結果として見えなくなることや存在しなくなることを表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["wa 'isam"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0076-07","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0101-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[{"kind":"contrasts","claim":"claim:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam--wa-isam-completive-disappearance-hokkaido","differs_in":"dialect","note":"Sakhalin vs general Ainu description of the resultative disappearance construction with wa isam"}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam--wa-isam-completive-disappearance-hokkaido","revision":1,"topic":"topic:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam","topics":["topic:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam","topic:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam--isam-verb"],"statement":{"en":"The construction wa isam corresponds to Japanese '-te shimatta' and indicates that something ceases to exist as a result.","ja":"構文 wa isam は日本語の「〜てしまった」に相当し、結果として存在しなくなるという文脈で用いられる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["wa isam"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0272-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam--the-verb-isam-is-a-lexical-negative-verb","revision":1,"topic":"topic:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam","topics":["topic:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam","topic:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam--isam-verb"],"statement":{"en":"The verb isam is a lexical negative verb that inherently incorporates the meaning of negation.","ja":"動詞 isam は語彙的否定動詞であり、否定の概念がその意味自体に含まれている。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["isam"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2022@handbook-epub/l0134-27","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam--to-the-author-s-knowledge-there-are-no","revision":1,"topic":"topic:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam","topics":["topic:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam","topic:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam--isam-verb"],"statement":{"en":"To the author's knowledge, there are no other examples of póka 'even just' directly preceding isam 'not exist'.","ja":"isam「ない」の直前に póka「だけでも」が置かれた用例は、著者の知る限り他にない。"},"type":"absence","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"none","modality":"actual","conditions":["isam の直前"]},"forms":["póka","isam"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0366-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam--the-verb-isam-means-not-exist-but-it","revision":1,"topic":"topic:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam","topics":["topic:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam","topic:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam--isam-verb"],"statement":{"en":"The verb isam means 'not exist', but it is also used to mean 'to die'.","ja":"動詞 isam は「ない」という意味であるが、「死ぬ」という意味でも用いられる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["isam"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0373-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam--certain-verbs-and-auxiliaries-in-shizunai-ainu-are","revision":1,"topic":"topic:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam","topics":["topic:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam","topic:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam--somo-interface"],"statement":{"en":"Certain verbs and auxiliaries in Shizunai Ainu are not negated with the adverb somo but instead have lexicalized declarative/negative pairs.","ja":"静内アイヌ語において一部の動詞や助動詞は否定副詞somoによって否定されず、語彙化された肯定／否定の対をもつ。"},"type":"existence","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"exists","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["somo","an","oka","isam","kor","sak","eramuan","eramuoka","erampe(w)tek","amkir","eramiskari","easkay"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0147-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam--certain-verbs-inherently-incorporate-negation-into-their-lexical","revision":1,"topic":"topic:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam","topics":["topic:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam","topic:negation/negation-existential-possessive-isam--system"],"statement":{"en":"Certain verbs inherently incorporate negation into their lexical meaning, such as isam 'not exist', sak 'lack', and erampewtek 'not understand/know'.","ja":"isam「存在しない」、sak「欠く」、erampewtek「理解しない／知らない」のように、語彙的意味の一部として否定を含む動詞が存在する。"},"type":"existence","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest"],"quantifier":"exists","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["isam","sak","erampewtek"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2012@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0020-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
